# TCLS r1: GLOBAL. The keys used to be the Classic keyboard (playing / writing the X0X pattern), and
# SAVE + a white key pasted it, HOME + a white key chained / cued it. None of that may run here now.
wait 300
tap GLO
expect view 5
expect cue 0
expect lanes 0
expect voices 0
press SAVE
tapkey w2
expect dirty 0               # the paste would have marked the project dirty
release SAVE
expect pattern 1
expect cue 0
press HOME
tapkey w3
expect cue 0                 # the chain / cue would have moved the part's cue to P4
release HOME
expect view 10
# the keys play nothing: the Classic keyboard (and its step edits) is gone
tap GLO
expect view 5
key 17 down
wait 300
expect voices 0
key 17 up
wait 200
expect voices 0
tap HOME
expect view 10
dump glo_pattern_gestures.json
